uz/en/dashboard/chat", "is_featured": true, "stat1_value": "", "stat1_label": "", "stat2_value": "", "stat2_label": "", "stat3_value": "", "stat3_label": "", "order": 1, "created_at": "2026-04-07T09:19:10.538Z"}}, {"model": "blog.post", "pk": 9, "fields": {"title": "The Future of Backend Architecture", "slug": "future-of-backend", "cover_image": "blog_covers/placeholder.png", "content": "\nIn this post, we explore how serverless and edge computing are reshaping the way we think about the backend.\n\n### Serverless is the key\nModern applications require horizontal scaling and minimal management overhead. Serverless functions allow us to focus on business logic while the infrastructure scales automatically.\n\n1. **Scalability**: Handle millions of requests effortlessly.\n2. **Cost-efficiency**: Pay only for what you use.\n3. **Speed**: Deploy in seconds.\n\nStay tuned for more insights into the world of distributed systems.\n", "excerpt": "Exploring how serverless and edge computing are reshaping the backend landscape.", "reading_time": 8, "published_at": "2026-04-05T11:48:54.309Z", "created_at": "2026-04-05T11:48:54.310Z"}}, {"model": "blog.post", "pk": 10, "fields": {"title": "Mastering Framer Motion in Next.js", "slug": "mastering-framer-motion", "cover_image": "blog_covers/placeholder.png", "content": "\nAnimations can make or break a user experience. In this tutorial, we will learn how to integrate Framer Motion into a Next.js application for premium UI transitions.\n\n```tsx\nimport { motion } from \"framer-motion\";\n\nexport const FadeIn = ({ children }) => (\n  <motion.div initial={{ opacity: 0 }} animate={{ opacity: 1 }}>\n    {children}\n  </motion.div>\n);\n```\n\nSimple, yet powerful.\n", "excerpt": "A deep dive into creating fluid, premium animations using Framer Motion.", "reading_time": 6, "published_at": "2026-04-05T11:48:54.312Z", "created_at": "2026-04-05T11:48:54.313Z"}}, {"model": "lectures.lecture", "pk": 9, "fields": {"title": "Ma'lumotlar ombori tarixi", "youtube_video_id": "oupN0dA3gcE", "description": "Ma'lumotlar omborlari qanday paydo bo'lgan, dastlabki tizimlardan zamonaviy relational DB gacha bo'lgan yo'l. Bu lecture keyingi barcha mavzular uchun asos bo'lib xizmat qiladi.", "category": "database", "duration_seconds": 750, "order": 1, "created_at": "2026-04-07T06:32:25.724Z"}}, {"model": "lectures.lecture", "pk": 10, "fields": {"title": "Ma'lumotlar ombori turlari", "youtube_video_id": "W2Z7GTo6Gis", "description": "Relational, NoSQL, NewSQL va boshqa turdagi ma'lumotlar omborlarining farqlari va qo'llanilishi.", "category": "database", "duration_seconds": 945, "order": 2, "created_at": "2026-04-07T06:32:25.727Z"}}, {"model": "lectures.lecture", "pk": 11, "fields": {"title": "Cloud42 amaliyot", "youtube_video_id": "b-610-8k6Xg", "description": "Cloud42 platformasida ma'lumotlar ombori bilan ishlash bo'yicha amaliy mashg'ulot.", "category": "database", "duration_seconds": 1100, "order": 3, "created_at": "2026-04-07T06:32:25.730Z"}}, {"model": "lectures.lecture", "pk": 12, "fields": {"title": "Jadvallar, qatorlar va ustunlar", "youtube_video_id": "pS6X9v_f8N0", "description": "Relational DB ning asosiy elementlari bilan tanishish.", "category": "database", "duration_seconds": 850, "order": 4, "created_at": "2026-04-07T06:32:25.732Z"}}, {"model": "lectures.lecture", "pk": 13, "fields": {"title": "Advanced networking with Python", "youtube_video_id": "3Z8X_U-YI0A", "description": "Python yordamida tarmoq protokollari bilan ishlash va skriptlar yozish.", "category": "networking", "duration_seconds": 1330, "order": 1, "created_at": "2026-04-07T06:32:25.735Z"}}, {"model": "about.bio", "pk": 1, "fields": {"photo": "bio/placeholder.png", "bio_text": "\n### Hello, I'm John Thompson\nI am a **Senior Software Engineer** with over 8 years of experience building scalable backend systems and high-performance web applications. My expertise lies in Python/Django and Scalable Backend Architectures.\n\nI specialize in:\n- **Backend Architecture**: Designing robust APIs and distributed systems.\n- **System Design**: Optimizing performance and security at scale.\n- **Database Optimization**: Managing high-load PostgreSQL and Redis environments.\n\nWhen I'm not coding, I enjoy sharing knowledge through my lectures and exploring new technologies.\n", "github_url": "https://github.com/acer", "linkedin_url": "https://linkedin.com/in/acer", "telegram_url": "https://t.me/acer", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@AsilbekRajab", "email": "john@example.com"}}, {"model": "about.experience", "pk": 9, "fields": {"title": "Senior Backend Engineer", "company": "Tech Giants Corp", "start_date": "2020-01-01", "end_date": null, "description": "Leading the core platform team, optimizing microservices, and implementing event-driven architectures with Django and Celery.", "order": 1}}, {"model": "about.experience", "pk": 10, "fields": {"title": "Full Stack Developer", "company": "Innovative Startups", "start_date": "2017-06-01", "end_date": "2019-12-31", "description": "Developed and maintained complex web applications using Django, PostgreSQL, and modern frontend tools.", "order": 2}}, {"model": "coffee.coffeerequest", "pk": 1, "fields": {"name": "Asibek rajab", "email": "asilbekrajab@gmail.com", "preferred_datetime": "2026-04-04T05:05:00Z", "location": "TAshkent", "topic": "adkasdjdhasjhdbasjhdbahjsdsahjdashj", "created_at": "2026-04-04T12:04:50.337Z"}}, {"model": "coffee.coffeerequest", "pk": 2, "fields": {"name": "Asilbek", "email": "asilbekrajab@gmail.com", "preferred_datetime": "2026-04-04T21:09:00Z", "location": "Tashkent", "topic": "Salom Salom Salom Salom Salom Salom Salom Salom Salom Salom", "created_at": "2026-04-04T12:08:49.771Z"}}]